{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15219280","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15219280","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1521928001:1":{"text":"기운 내고 이제 울지 말아요.\n여기는 그렇게 안전한 곳이 아니니, 빨리 떠나야 해요.","source_cn":"请振作一点，别再哭了。\\n这里不是很安全，要尽快离开才行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE107A0996A4D7F10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1521928002:1":{"text":"응... 네 말이 맞아.","source_cn":"对……你说得对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D4F6F9DF4B366FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521928003:1":{"text":"레이니, 보칼리스로 가지 않을래?\n...낸시르 아줌마랑 같이 사는 거야.","source_cn":"蕾妮，你想不想去呼临城？\\n……和南茜阿姨一起生活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D4D1AC97A27A8FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521928004:1":{"text":"어...","source_cn":"咦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDD605D1B2399700","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521928005:1":{"text":"보칼리스는... 안전한 곳이에요? 투타 마을처럼 좋은 곳이에요?","source_cn":"呼临城……那里安全吗？像图塔镇一样好吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BE128A20EF138CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521928006:1":{"text":"투타 마을처럼 좋은 곳은 아닐지도 모르지만... 아줌마랑 같이 살면 다시는 떠돌아다니지 않아도 된단다.","source_cn":"可能没有图塔镇那么好……但是你可以和我在一起，不用再颠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE1FFF112180C244","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521928007:1":{"text":"전쟁과 기근도 끝이야... 집도 있고, 먹을 것도 있고, 너도 무사히 자랄 수 있겠지...","source_cn":"战争和饥荒都结束了……我们会有房子，会有食物，你可以平...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x215120C25A7B78F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521928008:1":{"text":"네가 다 크고 나면... 다시 투타 마을로 돌아갈 수도 있을 거야.","source_cn":"等你长大以后……或许我们就可以再回到图塔镇了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16BA04A951CB2990","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521928009:1":{"text":"낸시르 아줌마는 저를 떠나지 않을 거죠? 아빠랑 엄마처럼 없어지지 않을 거죠? ...그렇죠? ","source_cn":"南茜阿姨，你不会离开我的，不会像爸爸妈妈那样……对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DF8E3C0462EAA17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521928010:1":{"text":"물론이지... 물론이란다, 얘야. 약속하마.","source_cn":"当然……当然，绝对不会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8439C9AD5EFC785","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_stat